    "the name of the training job. this name will be used to identify the job in the system and will the the filename of the final model. it must be unique and can only contain alphanumeric characters, underscores, and dashes. no spaces or special characters are allowed.": "训练任务的名称。该名称用于在系统中标识此任务，也将作为最终模型的文件名。必须唯一，只能包含字母、数字、下划线和连字符，不允许空格或特殊字符。",
    "this is the gpu that will be used for training. only one gpu can be used per job at a time via the ui currently. however, you can start multiple jobs in parallel, each using a different gpu.": "用于训练的 GPU。目前 UI 中每个任务一次只能使用一个 GPU，但你可以并行启动多个任务，各自使用不同的 GPU。",
    "optional: this will be the word or token used to trigger your concept or character.": "可选：用于触发你的概念或角色的单词或词元。",
    "when using a trigger word, if your captions do not contain the trigger word, it will be added automatically the beginning of the caption. if you do not have captions, the caption will become just the trigger word. if you want to have variable trigger words in your captions to put it in different spots, you can use the": "使用触发词时，如果描述（caption）中没有包含触发词，它会自动添加到描述开头。如果没有描述，描述将仅剩触发词本身。如果想让触发词出现在描述的不同位置，可以使用",
    "placeholder in your captions. this will be automatically replaced with your trigger word.": "占位符，它会自动替换为你的触发词。",
    "trigger words will not automatically be added to your test prompts, so you will need to either add your trigger word manually or use the": "触发词不会自动添加到测试提示词中，因此你需要手动添加触发词，或在测试提示词中也使用",
    "placeholder in your test prompts as well.": "占位符。",
    "the name of a diffusers repo on huggingface or the local path to the base model you want to train from. the folder needs to be in diffusers format for most models. for some models, such as sdxl and sd1, you can put the path to an all in one safetensors checkpoint here.": "Huggingface 上 diffusers 仓库的名称，或要用于训练的底模本地路径。大多数模型要求该目录为 diffusers 格式。部分模型（如 SDXL 和 SD1）可以在此填入单文件 safetensors 检查点的路径。",
    "the control dataset needs to have files that match the filenames of your training dataset. they should be matching file pairs. these images are fed as control/input images during training. the control images will be resized to match the training images.": "控制数据集的文件名需要与训练数据集一一对应，形成配对文件。这些图像在训练时作为控制/输入图像使用。控制图像会被缩放到与训练图像一致。",
    "for multi control datasets, the controls will all be applied in the order they are listed. if the model does not require the images to be the same aspect ratios, such as with qwen/qwen-image-edit-2509, then the control images do not need to match the aspect size or aspect ratio of the target image and they will be automatically resized to the ideal resolutions for the model / target images.": "多控制数据集中，各控制集按列出顺序依次生效。如果模型不要求图像保持相同宽高比（如 Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509），则控制图像无需与目标图像的尺寸或宽高比一致，它们会自动缩放到适合模型/目标图像的理想分辨率。",
    "this sets the number of frames to shrink videos to for a video dataset. if this dataset is images, set this to 1 for one frame. if your dataset is only videos, frames will be extracted evenly spaced from the videos in the dataset.": "设置视频数据集中视频统一缩到的帧数。如果该数据集是图像，请设为 1（单帧）。如果数据集只有视频，将从每条视频中均匀抽取指定数量的帧。",
    "it is best to trim your videos to the proper length before training. wan is 16 frames a second. doing 81 frames will result in a 5 second video. so you would want all of your videos trimmed to around 5 seconds for best results.": "训练前最好先把视频裁剪到合适的长度。Wan 为每秒 16 帧，81 帧即约 5 秒的视频。因此建议把所有视频都裁到 5 秒左右，效果最佳。",
    "example: setting this to 81 and having 2 videos in your dataset, one is 2 seconds and one is 90 seconds long, will result in 81 evenly spaced frames for each video making the 2 second video appear slow and the 90second video appear very fast.": "示例：设为 81 且数据集中有两条视频（一条 2 秒、一条 90 秒）时，每条视频都会被均匀抽取 81 帧，导致 2 秒的视频看起来很慢、90 秒的视频看起来飞快。",
    "for video models that can handle both i2v (image to video) and t2v (text to video), this option sets this dataset to be trained as an i2v dataset. this means that the first frame will be extracted from the video and used as the start image for the video. if this option is not set, the dataset will be treated as a t2v dataset.": "对于同时支持 I2V（图生视频）和 T2V（文生视频）的视频模型，此选项将该数据集按 I2V 方式训练：从视频中抽取首帧作为视频的起始图像。若不开启，则按 T2V 数据集处理。",
    "for models that support audio with video, this option will load the audio from the video and resize it to match the video sequence. since the video is automatically resized, the audio may drop or raise in pitch to match the new speed of the video. it is important to prep your dataset to have the proper length before training.": "对于支持音视频的模型，此选项会加载视频中的音频并拉伸/压缩以匹配视频序列。由于视频会被自动调整时长，音频音调可能随之升高或降低。训练前务必把数据集处理到合适的长度。",
    "when loading audio, this will normalize the audio volume to the max peaks. useful if your dataset has varying audio volumes. warning, do not use if you have clips with full silence you want to keep, as it will raise the volume of those clips.": "加载音频时将音量按最大峰值归一化。数据集音量参差不齐时很有用。注意：如果想保留完全静音的片段请勿开启，因为会抬高这些片段的音量。",
    "when loading audio to match the number of frames requested, this option will preserve the pitch of the audio if the length does not match training target. it is recommended to have a dataset that matches your target length, as this option can add sound distortions.": "加载音频以匹配指定帧数时，若时长与训练目标不一致，此选项会保持音调不变（变速不变调）。建议让数据集时长与目标一致，因为此选项可能带来声音失真。",
    "you can augment your dataset on the fly by flipping the x (horizontal) and/or y (vertical) axis. flipping a single axis will effectively double your dataset. it will result it training on normal images, and the flipped versions of the images. this can be very helpful, but keep in mind it can also be destructive. there is no reason to train people upside down, and flipping a face can confuse the model as a person's right side does not look identical to their left side. for text, obviously flipping text is not a good idea.": "通过水平（X 轴）和/或垂直（Y 轴）翻转来实时增强数据集。翻转单个轴相当于把数据集扩大一倍：正常图像和翻转图像都会参与训练。这很有用，但也可能有害——没必要训练倒立的人，而且人脸左右并不完全对称，翻转会让模型困惑。对含文字的图像，翻转文字显然不是好主意。",
    "control images for a dataset will also be flipped to match the images, so they will always match on the pixel level.": "数据集的控制图像也会同步翻转以保持像素级对齐。",
    "unloading text encoder will cache the trigger word and the sample prompts and unload the text encoder from the gpu. captions in for the dataset will be ignored": "卸载文本编码器会缓存触发词和采样提示词，并从 GPU 卸载文本编码器。数据集的描述（caption）将被忽略。",
    "caching text embeddings will process and cache all the text embeddings from the text encoder to the disk. the text encoder will be unloaded from the gpu. this does not work with things that dynamically change the prompt such as trigger words, caption dropout, etc.": "缓存文本嵌入会把文本编码器产生的全部文本嵌入处理并缓存到磁盘，随后文本编码器将从 GPU 卸载。不兼容会动态改变提示词的功能，如触发词、描述 dropout 等。",
    "some models have multi stage networks that are trained and used separately in the denoising process. most common, is to have 2 stages. one for high noise and one for low noise. you can choose to train both stages at once or train them separately. if trained at the same time, the trainer will alternate between training each model every so many steps and will output 2 different loras. if you choose to train only one stage, the trainer will only train that stage and output a single lora.": "部分模型具有多阶段网络，在去噪过程中分别训练和使用。最常见的是两阶段：一个负责高噪声、一个负责低噪声。可以选择同时训练两个阶段或分开训练。同时训练时，训练器会每隔若干步轮换训练各模型，并输出两个不同的 LoRA；若只训练一个阶段，则只输出单个 LoRA。",
    "when training a model with multiple stages, this setting controls how often the trainer will switch between training each stage.": "训练多阶段模型时，此设置控制训练器在各阶段之间切换的频率。",
    "for low vram settings, the model not being trained will be unloaded from the gpu to save memory. this takes some time to do, so it is recommended to alternate less often when using low vram. a setting like 10 or 20 is recommended for low vram settings.": "低显存模式下，当前未训练的模型会从 GPU 卸载以节省显存。切换需要一定时间，因此低显存时建议降低切换频率，设为 10 或 20 即可。",
    "the swap happens at the batch level, meaning it will swap between a gradient accumulation steps. to train both stages in a single step, set them to switch every 1 step and set gradient accumulation to 2.": "切换发生在 batch 层级（即梯度累积步之间）。若要在单步内训练两个阶段，可把切换间隔设为 1 步并将梯度累积设为 2。",
    "this option will force the trainer to generate samples when it starts. the trainer will normally only generate a first sample when nothing has been trained yet, but will not do a first sample when resuming from an existing checkpoint. this option forces a first sample every time the trainer is started. this can be useful if you have changed sample prompts and want to see the new prompts right away.": "此选项强制训练器在启动时立即生成采样图。默认情况下，只有在从未训练过时才会生成首张采样图，从已有检查点恢复时则不会。开启后每次启动训练器都会强制生成，适合改了采样提示词想立刻看效果的情况。",
    "this is an experimental feature based on": "这是一项实验性功能，基于",
    ". this feature is early and will have many updates and changes, so be aware it may not work consistently from one update to the next. it will also only work with certain models.": "。该功能处于早期阶段，会有大量更新和改动，可能在不同版本间表现不一致，且仅适用于部分模型。",
    "layer offloading uses the cpu ram instead of the gpu ram to hold most of the model weights. this allows training a much larger model on a smaller gpu, assuming you have enough cpu ram. this is slower than training on pure gpu ram, but cpu ram is cheaper and upgradeable. you will still need gpu ram to hold the optimizer states and lora weights, so a larger card is usually still needed.": "层卸载用 CPU 内存代替显存来存放大部分模型权重，只要 CPU 内存足够，就能在较小的 GPU 上训练更大的模型。这比纯显存训练慢，但内存更便宜且可扩容。优化器状态和 LoRA 权重仍需显存存放，所以通常还是需要较大的显卡。",
    "you can also select the percentage of the layers to offload. it is generally best to offload as few as possible (close to 0%) for best performance, but you can offload more if you need the memory.": "还可以选择卸载层的比例。为性能计，一般建议尽量少卸载（接近 0%），显存不足时再调高。",
    "this setting will make the control images match the resolution of the target image. the official inference example for qwen-image-edit-2509 feeds the control image is at 1mp resolution, no matter what size you are generating. doing this makes training at lower res difficult because 1mp control images are fed in despite how large your target image is. match target res will match the resolution of your target to feed in the control images allowing you to use less vram when training with smaller resolutions. you can still use different aspect ratios, the image will just be resizes to match the amount of pixels in the target image.": "此设置让控制图像的分辨率与目标图像一致。Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 的官方推理示例无论生成尺寸如何都以 1MP 分辨率送入控制图像，这导致低分辨率训练变得困难——不管目标图多小，送入的仍是 1MP 控制图。开启本项后控制图会匹配目标图分辨率，小分辨率训练时可显著省显存。宽高比仍可不同，图像只会缩放到与目标图相同的像素总量。",
    "differential output preservation (dop) is a technique to help preserve class of the trained concept during training. for this, you must have a trigger word set to differentiate your concept from its class. for instance, you may be training a woman named alice. your trigger word may be \"alice\". the class is \"woman\", since alice is a woman. we want to teach the model to remember what it knows about the class \"woman\" while teaching it what is different about alice. during training, the trainer will make a prediction with your lora bypassed and your trigger word in the prompt replaced with the class word. making \"photo of alice\" become \"photo of woman\". this prediction is called the prior prediction. each step, we will do the normal training step, but also do another step with this prior prediction and the class prompt in order to teach our lora to preserve the knowledge of the class. this should not only improve the performance of your trained concept, but also allow you to do things like \"alice standing next to a woman\" and not make both of the people look like alice.": "差分输出保留（DOP）是一种在训练中保留所学概念「类别」知识的技巧。需要设置触发词来区分你的概念与它的类别。例如训练一位叫 Alice 的女性：触发词是 \"Alice\"，类别是 \"woman\"（因为 Alice 是一位女性）。我们要让模型既记住 \"woman\" 这个类别的原有知识，又学会 Alice 的差异之处。训练时，训练器会先绕过 LoRA 并把提示词中的触发词替换为类别词做一次预测（\"photo of Alice\" 变成 \"photo of woman\"），这称为先验预测。每一步除了正常训练外，还会基于该先验预测和类别提示词额外训练一步，教 LoRA 保留类别知识。这不仅能提升训练概念的效果，还能让「Alice 和一位女性站在一起」这类提示词里两个人不会都长成 Alice。",
    "blank prompt preservation (bpp) is a technique to help preserve the current models knowledge when unprompted. this will not only help the model become more flexible, but will also help the quality of your concept during inference, especially when a model uses cfg (classifier free guidance) on inference. at each step during training, a prior prediction is made with a blank prompt and with the lora disabled. this prediction is then used as a target on an additional training step with a blank prompt, to preserve the model's knowledge when no prompt is given. this helps the model to not overfit to the prompt and retain its generalization capabilities.": "空提示保留（BPP）用于在无提示时保留模型原有的知识。它能让模型更灵活，也能提升推理时概念的质量——尤其在使用 CFG（无分类器引导）的模型上。训练的每一步都会禁用 LoRA 并以空提示做一次先验预测，该预测再作为额外一步空提示训练的目标，从而保留模型在无提示时的知识。这能防止模型过拟合到提示词上，保持泛化能力。",
    "differential guidance will amplify the difference of the model prediction and the target during training to make a new target. differential guidance scale will be the multiplier for the difference. this is still experimental, but in my tests, it makes the model train faster, and learns details better in every scenario i have tried with it.": "差分引导会在训练时放大模型预测与目标之间的差异，生成一个新目标。差分引导缩放（Scale）即差异的放大倍数。此功能仍是实验性的，但在作者的测试中，它让模型训练更快、细节学习更好。",
    "the idea is that normal training inches closer to the target but never actually gets there, because it is limited by the learning rate. with differential guidance, we amplify the difference for a new target beyond the actual target, this would make the model learn to hit or overshoot the target instead of falling short.": "原理：常规训练受学习率限制，只能一点点逼近目标而难以真正到达。差分引导把差异放大、把新目标推到实际目标之外，让模型学会命中甚至越过目标，而不是每次都差一点。",
    "number of repeats will allow you to repeate the items in a dataset multiple times. this is useful when you are using multiple datasets and want to balance the number of samples from each dataset. for instance, if you have a small dataset of 10 images and a large dataset of 100 images, you can set the small dataset to have 10 repeats to effectively make it 100 images, making the two datasets occour equally during training.": "重复次数让数据集中的条目在训练中重复多次。使用多个数据集并想平衡各集合的样本量时很有用。例如：小数据集 10 张图、大数据集 100 张图，把小数据集的重复次数设为 10，等效于 100 张图，两个数据集在训练中出现频率就一致了。",
    "when training audio and video, sometimes the video loss is so great that it outweights the audio loss, causing the audio to become distorted. if you are noticing this happen, you can increase the audio loss multiplier to give more weight to the audio loss. you could try something like 2.0, 10.0 etc. warning, setting this too high could overfit and damage the model.": "训练音视频时，视频损失有时会远大于音频损失，把音频带偏导致失真。出现这种情况时可以调高音频损失倍率，加大音频损失的权重，比如 2.0、10.0 等。注意：设得太高可能过拟合并损坏模型。",
    "this will automatically determine the number of frames to use for each video in your dataset instead of relying on a fixed num_frames. this allows you to include videos of different lengths in the dataset, and each video will be processed without speeding up or slowing down. be careful about adding long videos into your dataset, as they use up more vram. this currently will not work with a batch size greater than 1.": "自动确定数据集中每条视频应使用的帧数，而不是依赖固定的帧数值。这样数据集可以包含不同长度的视频，且每条视频都按原速处理（不加速不减速）。注意长视频会占用更多显存。目前 batch size 大于 1 时不可用。",
    "the instruction the model is asked for every training item, as the user turn of the chat. the item's caption file is the answer it learns to give. use the same wording when running the trained lora, and it is also what samples use when their own prompt is left blank.": "每个训练条目都会以对话中用户轮次的形式向模型发出这段指令，条目的描述（caption）文件就是模型要学着给出的回答。使用训练好的 LoRA 时请用相同的措辞；采样提示词留空时也会使用它。",
    "this will enable kv cache for control images in a model that supports it. loras trained with this on need to also be inferenced with it, and vice versa. this does not speed up or slow down training, but on inference, the control images only need to be processed once for the entire generation, vs being processed for every step. which leads to a significant speedup on inference.": "在支持的模型上为控制图像启用 KV 缓存。开启此项训练的 LoRA 推理时也需开启，反之亦然。它不影响训练速度，但推理时控制图像整个过程只需处理一次（而非每步都处理），能显著加速推理。",
    "for contrastive guidance loss, this is the target cgf to amplify predictions to.": "对比引导损失中，预测被放大到的目标 CFG 值。",
    "caption dropout rate is the probability that the caption for an image will be dropped (replaced with a blank caption) for any given training step. for example, a value of 0.05 will drop the caption around 5% of the time. dropping captions helps the model learn the concept being trained without relying entirely on the caption, and helps preserve the model's ability to generate without a prompt. if a trigger word is set, the trigger word is still used when the caption is dropped, so the model still associates the dropped samples with your trigger word. regularization images, or images without a trigger word, drop to a fully blank caption.": "描述 dropout 率是每一步训练中该图像描述被丢弃（替换为空描述）的概率。例如 0.05 表示约 5% 的时间丢弃描述。丢弃描述能帮助模型不完全依赖文字来学习训练概念，也有助于保持无提示生成的能力。若设置了触发词，丢弃描述时仍会保留触发词，模型仍会把被丢弃的样本关联到触发词上。正则化图像或没有触发词的图像，则完全置空描述。",
    "caption dropout also works when caching text embeddings. an additional embedding for the dropout caption (blank, or the trigger word alone) is cached to disk alongside the normal one, and it is randomly swapped in at train time at this rate.": "缓存文本嵌入时描述 dropout 同样有效：dropout 描述（空或仅触发词）的额外嵌入会和正常嵌入一起缓存到磁盘，训练时按此概率随机换入。",
    "experimental": "实验性",
    "experimental)": "实验性）",
    "(": "（",
    "validation runs a stable loss check on a fixed set of images. each image is encoded once at startup and predicted at the selected sigmas with fixed seeds, so the result is always deterministic and comparable across the run. the average loss is logged as val/loss every time validation runs. the images need to match the concept of your dataset, but": "验证功能在一组固定图片上执行稳定的 loss 检测。每张图片在启动时编码一次，并按选定的 sigma 与固定种子进行预测，因此结果始终是确定性的，整个训练过程可横向对比。每次验证的平均 loss 会记录为 val/loss。这些图片需要符合数据集的概念，但",
    "do not include the validation images in the dataset": "请勿将验证图片放进训练数据集",
    ". they must be images containing the concept you want to train, but not an image trained on.": "。它们必须是包含你要训练概念的图片，但不能是被训练过的图片。"
  },
